<title>USA: TABLE - Hawaiian Air says June load factor up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Hawaiian Air says June load factor up.</headline>
<dateline>HONOLULU 1997-07-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>--</p>
<p>						 1997		1996</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  86.0		78.1</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	     387.2	     334.8</p>
<p> Available seat miles		  450.0	     428.6</p>
<p> Total cargo ton miles		   4.2		 4.3</p>
<p>					    Year-to-date</p>
<p> Load factor - percent		  76.5		 76.2</p>
<p> Revenue passenger miles	   2,115.3	    1,914.1</p>
<p> Available seat miles		2,766.1	    2,511.8</p>
<p> Total cargo ton miles		  28.6		 24.9</p>
<p>(Revenue passenger and available seat miles in 000,000s)</p>
<p>NOTES: Hawaiian carried 448,417 passengers in June 1997, an increase of 1.3 percent from 442,626 passengers reported for June 1996.</p>
<p>It carried a total of 2,625,946 passengers during the first six months of 1997, an increase of 0.6 percent from 2,611,437 carried during the same period in 1996.</p>
<p>Hawaiian Airlines Inc.</p>
